lease randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nWang Ming attends his favorite football team's live game for the first time. The moment the team scores, the whole field erupts in cheers, and Wang Ming waves the team flag in the crowd.\n\n[Question]\nWang Ming should be excited when his team scores, but he seems angry, why?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Although Wang Ming's favorite team scores, he is dissatisfied with the performance of one of the players.\nB. After scoring, the opposing team's players insult and push the players of the team Wang Ming likes.\nC. Wang Ming thinks a referee's decision is against his favorite team, so he is angry.\nD. Some noisy behaviors that Wang Ming does not like happen on the field, which makes him angry.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.001169485249110863,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af52adac2ddb05a7fe2f0c2","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794452186035,"createTime":"2026-11-12 10:56:26","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"3b950943c33042b0856bc4a5d91072aa"}